# ==============================================================================
# FILE HEADER: Root Git Ignore Policy — Antigravity Enterprise Reference Repo
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Prevents accidental commits of environment secret files, API keys, TLS
#   certificates, rendered local MDM configs, GCP service account tokens,
#   compiled binaries, Python virtual environments, and OS/IDE noise across
#   all modules (`enterprise-gateway/`, `vm-provisioning/`, `agy-config/`).
#
# Architecture / Context:
#   Repository-wide `.gitignore` placed at the root of `AntigravityEnterpriseGateway/`
#   so the entire reorganized folder can be initialized directly as a standalone Git repository.
#
# Dependencies / Side Effects:
#   Explicitly preserves tracked `.env.example` and `settings.env` templates
#   while force-excluding all `.env` and `*.local.*` runtime files.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Secrets, Environment Files & Rendered Local Configs
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.json
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml
*.local.env
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*key*.json
!**/templates/*.json
!**/configs/**/*.json
!enterprise-gateway/admin_settings.json

# Cryptographic keys, certificates & keystores
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.kdbx
*.crt
*.cer
*.der

# Remote Desktop & SSH artifacts
*.rdp
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Language Runtime, Build & Dependency Artifacts (Python & Go)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Go binaries & coverage profiles
enterprise-gateway/go/gateway
enterprise-gateway/go/antigravity-gateway
*.exe
*.out
coverage.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Runtime Logs, Audit Trails & MDM Backups
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.jsonl
*.bak
*.orig
backups/
audit/
temp/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OS & IDE Metadata Noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
